  "_comment": "Pins 202590c (#35, OpenAI embeddings take content parts with images and audio). The OpenAI SDK shape llama.cpp's multimodal embedding models (EmbeddingGemma 2) and OpenRouter take: one vector per {\"content\": [...]} input of text, image_url and input_audio parts. The parser only knew strings and Jina's {text}/{image} objects, so this request 400'd with \"object inputs must carry `text` or `image`\", and an input of several parts could not be emitted at all. It must parse and go upstream in the same shape.",
